    "body": "### What\n\nFor a specific set of public APIs we want calls to be idempotent, i.e. another call of this function would not change state and would not cause an error. An example for such a call would be OfferService() on as mw::com Skeleton. \n\nGoal of this task would be to have one dedicated integration test that ensures that all API calls work as expected. (So far this has been included in different integration tests.)\n\nThis is the (current) list of  APIs that should be covered by this integration test:\n\n- OfferService\n\n- StopOfferService\n\n- StartFindService\n\n- Subscribe\n\n- Unsubscribe\n\n### How\n\nAdd an integration test to score/communication. \n\n### Estimates for realization\n\n_No response_\n\n### Category\n\n- [ ] Affects Detailed Design\n\n### Requirements / Architecture\n\n- [x] Requirements / Architecture are not affected by this change?",
